{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49392","headline":"接贤宾 · 毛文锡","name":"接贤宾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"香鞯镂襜五色骢，值春景初融。\n流珠喷沫躞蹀，汗血流红。\n少年公子能乘驭，金镳玉辔珑璁。\n爲惜珊瑚鞭不下，骄生百步千踪。\n信穿花，从拂柳，向九陌追风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛文锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}